  "comment": "Opensipsctl is a usefull tool provided by OpenSIPS, that can be used for, Adding users Check who's online Monitoring opensips activities To add user, we can use # opensipsctl add number@host password # opensipsctl add 2000@192.168.0.3 123456 To see who's online # opensipsctl ul show number@host # opensipsctl ul show 2000@192.168.0.3 To monitor OpenSIPS Softswitch activities # opensipsctl monitor",
